# No extension installed and the toolbar hidden (Niche's default): hovering the sidebar's header
# shows Copy Link and the Site Control Center's sliders in the URL field, and a press on the
# sliders opens the Site Control Center (Share, Boost, Capture, settings), as in Arc. Until
# 0.1.33 the sliders showed only with an extension installed, so there was no way in (#226).
# Then View > Show Toolbar: the toolbar carries the sliders without extensions too.
# promise: #226
budget rss=600 stalls50=6
niche://debug?windowSize=1280x800
niche://open?url=${PAGE}?n=sitecontrols
wait 3
niche://debug?urlFieldHover=1
expect-log url field: copyURL siteControls$
niche://debug?urlFieldPress=siteControls
wait 1
expect-log url field press siteControls: pressed true, site control center shown
niche://debug?urlFieldHover=0
niche://action/toggleToolbar
wait 1
niche://debug?urlFieldHover=1
expect-log url field: none
niche://action/toggleToolbar
wait 1
